Build a prioritization system with Eric: OKRs tied to (a) the areas he is evaluated on and (b) the three pillars. Inputs: `Projects/Applied-Performance-JD-2026/`, `Inbox/meetings/2026-04-27_Chris_Ruf__Performance_Review__Check_ins.md`, `Inbox/meetings/2026-08-27_Applied_Performance__Job_Profiles_FMS__Logistics.md`. Open first with: why did the 5/22, 6/2 and 7/31 fixes stop working?
